=== Scenario 10 (FABRIC TEST-NETWORK): proactive caller-authorisation
=== hardening, version 3.1, sequence 6. Produced by
=== scripts/scenario_10_proactive_hardening_live.sh against the same
=== three-organisation Fabric test-network used throughout this
=== dissertation. Unedited console output below (ANSI colour codes
=== stripped only).
===
=== This version closes three residual gaps identified proactively,
=== anticipating further supervisor review rather than waiting for it:
=== (1) RecordShipment's toOrg (the new Owner) was never validated, so a
=== mistyped or fabricated destination could permanently orphan a token;
=== (2) RecordAssembly checked only that the caller *was* the OEM, never
=== that the OEM actually *held* each listed component; (3) declared
=== CoAttestingOrgs names were accepted verbatim with no check that they
=== named a real, deployed organisation.

